3. Large organizations

If you use Coool PM on behalf of an organization whose consolidated gross
revenue exceeded US $2 million in its most recently completed fiscal year,
the permission in section 1 requires a separate written agreement covering
each user. For this threshold, count the organization and entities it
controls, is controlled by, or shares common control with.

